Everything under `data/`, and every export produced by this project, is
licensed CC BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You may share and adapt it, including commercially, provided you give
appropriate credit and indicate whether changes were made.

A condition of good-faith reuse: **republish the confidence and verification
columns with the data.** Every record in this dataset carries a confidence
score and a verification status. A figure separated from them misrepresents the
research, and model estimates produced by this project are not official figures
and must not be aggregated with them.

